# ChangeLog

## [Unreleased]

### Added
- Regenerate `apertium-ido-epo.ido-epo.dix` from unified JSON sources (BERT, Vortaro, extractor)
- Add ~29,000 bidix entries covering ~12,000 Ido lemmas
- Integrate BERT-aligned candidates with Vortaro-format and extractor-derived translations

### Changed
- Update bilingual dictionary entries to align with new monodix/YAML pipeline
- Improve coverage for common and proper-noun vocabulary

### Technical
- Source JSONs: `bert_aligned_clean_0.60/bert_candidates.json`, `vortaro_format/ido_epo_dictionary.json`, `extractor/dist/bidix_big.json`
- Regeneration scripts: `projects/embedding-aligner/scripts/regenerate_bidix.py`, `regenerate_monodix.py`

## [0.1.0] - 2025-01-26

### Added
- Initial release of Ido-Esperanto translation pair
- Basic morphological analysis and generation
- Bilingual dictionary with number handling
- Transfer rules for basic translation
- Post-generation rules for both languages

### Fixed
- Proper number handling in translation pipeline
- Configuration files for Apertium build system
